    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>SPF is a simple plugin to create a fancybox on click on pictures. Few options to keep it simple, but fast and efficient. Good plugin for developers.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/simple-picture-fancybox</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>Use the Sliders screen to create or edit sliders</li>\n<li>Copy shortcode or PHP code and put it in your theme</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Création du plugin</li>\n</ul>\n"
